# `gh pr merge --squash --delete-branch` — no number at all, the ordinary form when a run merges its own PR from its own worktree. `gh` printed which PR it merged, and that is the number: after `--delete-branch` the checkout is on the base, so the current branch's PR would be the wrong one. #286
